==History==
2016
*The Rocket [[Cards|card]] was added with Clash Royale's game launch on 4/1/2016 {{Balance|Add}}.
*On 19/2/2016, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (19/2/2016)|Balance Update]], decreased the Rocket's [[:Category:Crown Towers|Crown Tower]] damage to 40% of the full damage (from 50%) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 3/5/2016, the [[Version History#May 2016 Update (3/5/2016)|May 2016 Update]], increased the {{Rarity|Rare}} card Level cap to 11 (from 10) {{Balance|Buff}}.
2017 
*On 13/3/2017, the [[Version History#March%202017%20Update%20(13/3/2017)|March 2017 Update]], fixed a bug when using a Rocket on 2 [[Ice Golem|Ice Golems]] would result in the Rocket dealing double damage {{Balance|Neutral}}.
*On 12/12/2017, the [[Version History#Electrifying Update (12/12/2017)|Electrifying Update]], decreased the Rocket’s Crown Tower damage to 35% of the full damage (from 40%) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
2018
*On 25/4/2018, the [[Version History#Clan%20Wars%20Update%20(25/4/2018)|Clan Wars Update]], allowed the Rocket to be placed on the river {{Balance|Neutral}}.
*On 20/6/2018, the [[Version History#Summer%202018%20Update%20(20/6/2018)|Summer 2018 Update]], moved the [[Arenas|Arena]] to unlock the Rocket from Barbarian Bowl (Arena 3) to Builder's Workshop (Arena 6) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 5/9/2018, the [[Version History#September%202018%20Update%20(5/9/2018)|September 2018 Update]], changed it so that {{Rarity|Rare}} cards start at Level 3 and end at Level 13 (from 1 to 11) {{Balance|Neutral}}.
*On 1/10/2018, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (1/10/2018)|Balance Update]], fixed a bug where troops that were spawned after their parent troops died would be immune to spell damage {{Balance|Neutral}}.
2019
*On 15/4/2019, the [[Version History#April%202019%20Update%20(15/4/2019)|April 2019 Update]], added two extra [[Star Points|Star Levels]] {{Balance|Add}}.
*On 26/11/2019, the [[Version History#End%20of%20November%202019%20Update%20(26/11/2019)|End of November 2019 Update]], added a card render to the Rocket's card info screen {{Balance|Add}}.
2020
*On 4/8/2020, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (4/8/2020)|Balance Update]], decreased the Rocket’s Crown Tower damage to 30% of the full damage (from 35%) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
2021 
*On 27/10/2021, the [[Version History#Champions%20Update%20(27/10/2021)|Champions Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 14 (from 13) {{Balance|Buff}}.
2023
*On 7/2/2023, a [[Version History#Balance Changes (7/2/2023)|Balance Update]], decreased the Rocket's Crown Tower damage to 25% of the full damage (from 30%) {{Balance|Nerf}}.
*On 19/6/2023, the [[Version History#Card%20Evolution%20Update%20(19/6/2023)|Card Evolution Update]], increased the Level cap of all cards to 15 (from 14) {{Balance|Buff}}.
2026

* On 1/6/2026, a Balance Update, decreased the Rocket's Crown Tower damage to 23% of the full damage (from 25%)

